title: '`pallet-pgas-allowance`: test weight reservation and refund math'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Adds tests for the weight reservation formula in `weight()`
      (`charge_pgas.max(inner + charge_pgas_skip)`) and the weight each path returns in
      post-dispatch: the PGAS path, the signed inner fallback, and the unsigned fallback. Also
      covers the full-burn branch when the refund cannot be resolved to the payer and the
      `InvalidTransaction::Payment` rejection when the PGAS balance drops between validate and
      prepare. Test-only, no behavior change.

crates:
  - name: pallet-pgas-allowance
    bump: none
